segments.text:
Let the three positions in the line be P1, P2, and P3, from left to right.
Each person has a unique set of attributes: Beverage (B), Hobby (H), Nationality (N), Sport (S).
Possible values:
B: {mirinda, 7up, sprite}
H: {skydiving, board-games, sudoku}
N: {thai, canadian, mexican}
S: {soccer, parkour, ice-hockey}
